><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0a061583-2dae-41db-82e1-54e0ddc02726\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0a061583-2dae-41db-82e1-54e0ddc02726\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On the corpse of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Penela_Lumpensicks\" title=\"Penela Lumpensicks\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Portrait_Penela_Lumpensicks.png/20px-Portrait_Penela_Lumpensicks.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Portrait_Penela_Lumpensicks.png/30px-Portrait_Penela_Lumpensicks.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Portrait_Penela_Lumpensicks.png/40px-Portrait_Penela_Lumpensicks.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Penela Lumpensicks\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Portrait_Penela_Lumpensicks.png/20px-Portrait_Penela_Lumpensicks.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Portrait_Penela_Lumpensicks.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Penela_Lumpensicks\" title=\"Penela Lumpensicks\">Penela Lumpensicks</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Under_Temple_Cave_Area\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Under Temple Cave Area\">cave underneath the Open Hand Temple</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;64&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-1028</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>The Effigy of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Illasera\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/33px-BGWiki.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/44px-BGWiki.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Illasera\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/BGWiki.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Illasera\">Illasera</a></span>, who watched and waited.\n</p><p><br>\nWhat use her eyes? She thought herself a huntress, but couldn't fathom her wool.\n</p><p><br>\n[Below is an exaggerated signature, written in blood]\n</p><p><br>\nOrin the Red\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200719\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2069/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33522/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8668/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 976896/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   53.885      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   53.885      1 -total\n 56.19%   30.280      9 Template:Icon_text\n 49.30%   26.567     21 Template:Trim\n 20.22%   10.894      2 Template:Uid\n 18.93%   10.202      4 Template:Icon_link\n 12.78%    6.889      1 Template:Main_only\n 11.89%    6.408      2 Template:Templa